# Virtua Striker
#
# GAME SYSTEM / COUNTRY: JPN to USA.
# The service button moves the cursor; the test button selects.
#
# Drives the game's own test menu, because that is the only supported way to
# change a setting these boards keep in battery-backed RAM. Regenerate with:
#
#     tools/make-defaults.sh vstriker
run 700
testmenu 60
run 150
input in0 0xF7
run 5
input in0 0xFF
run 15
input in0 0xF7
run 5
input in0 0xFF
run 15
input in0 0xFB
run 5
input in0 0xFF
run 15
run 40
input in0 0xF7
run 5
input in0 0xFF
run 15
